config RAK_RUI_API
	bool "RAK extensions to the Arduino API"
	depends on ARDUINO_API
	default n
	help
	  Build the RAK additions in cores/arduino/rak and make them part of the
	  Arduino core.

	  With this option disabled the core behaves like upstream
	  ArduinoCore-zephyr and none of the RAK sources are compiled.

config RAK_EXPORT_MATH
	bool "Export the math.h functions to sketches"
	default y
	help
	  Link the math.h functions into the loader and export them to
	  sketches, like upstream ArduinoCore-zephyr.

	  With this option disabled the loader leaves them out and every
	  sketch links only the math functions it calls.

config RAK_EXPORT_LIBC_EXTRAS
	bool "Export mktime() and strerror_r() to sketches"
	default y
	help
	  Link mktime() and the XSI strerror_r() used by std::error_code into
	  the loader and export them to sketches, like upstream
	  ArduinoCore-zephyr.

	  With this option disabled the loader leaves them out and a sketch
	  that calls one of them links its own copy.

rsource "modules/Kconfig"
